  "count": 2,
  "rationale": "Block tokenCache:credentialAccess and backupHost:lateralMovement. Blocking tokenCache cuts off dbLogin, rdpLogin and apiToken. That makes printServer, jumpHost and hypervisor unreachable, and secretsManager unreachable as well. Blocking backupHost cuts codeRepo's last route and starves serviceAccount. All four parents of the target (vaultRead, dbReplica, codeRepo, shareMount) are then unreachable. One block is not enough: backupHost reaches codeRepo through kerberoast or browserStore, and printServer reaches shareMount through tokenCache. These two routes share no blockable node, so no single block stops both."
 },
